icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"f9dd6c76c7abef63c1904014801788f6157347ec1388c08c296068c3442e1e03"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"fbc84809b395af600b1df3df32eeea05784cd17749dd96c4f5afb45ca57fac13"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"7d8e9172f9d0c8b5332df599f03f96471c83f8e9bde81c0809180df9c6225a24"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"114.0.5735.110"}